B.bg6=s(['1. Check if the thermostat screen is blank or showing "Low Battery" \xe2\u20ac\u201d replace the 2 AA/AAA batteries inside the faceplate.',"2. Verify the mode is set to HEAT (above current room temp) or COOL (below current room temp).","3. Check that the furnace service switch (looks like a light switch near the unit) wasn't accidentally flipped off.","4. Inspect the air filter; a heavily clogged filter can trip the high-limit safety switch."],t.s)
